	'k0d552fed' => 'Yes. Internal candidates may be evaluated alongside external market candidates. To preserve impartiality, fairness, and internal morale, we offer a dedicated internal candidate assessment for €6,500 per person. This service includes one in-depth structured competency assessment conducted by Priya Raman and the lead partner, along with two rigorous independent reference checks. We benchmark the internal candidate against the exact same role brief and performance standards used for external executives on the market map. This transparent benchmarking provides the board and chief executive with objective evidence when deciding between internal succession and external market appointment.',
