	'k1e0b57b7' => 'We concentrate exclusively on eight executive seats across European business. For financial leadership, Helena Marsh conducts searches for Chief Financial Officer appointments. Tomás Ferreira leads mandates for Chief Operating Officer and Head of Plant Operations, focusing on operations, factories, and supply chain infrastructure. Amara Okonkwo handles General Counsel and corporate compliance leadership. Mei-Lin Huang leads searches for Chief Technology Officer, product leadership, and chief data officers. We also recruit Chief People Officers who oversee modern organizational design, Managing Directors for European regional divisions, and Board Chairs alongside independent non-executive directors. Each seat is managed by a partner who understands the specific technical, legal, and operational metrics required to evaluate candidate caliber accurately.',
