	'k2e18264b' => 'Senbatsu Partners, based at Oostelijke Handelskade 1210, 1019 BL Amsterdam, acts as the data controller for personal information gathered during retained executive search engagements. When compiling market maps of about 60 individuals, our research team processes professional career histories, public publications, and verified business qualifications. Candidate data is processed solely to assess executive suitability against defined role briefs. We never sell, lease, or distribute data to third parties or marketing platforms. All dossiers, referencing notes compiled by Priya Raman, and assessment records are stored in encrypted environments accessible only to our seven-person team. Information is retained only as long as necessary to conduct the search and satisfy statutory European compliance obligations.',
