	'k5566a173' => 'Interviews and formal referencing take place between weeks 7 and 11. Associate Priya Raman coordinates comprehensive reference calls and competency assessments to verify operational milestones and leadership character. The managing partner prepares both client and candidate for structured meetings and debriefs after each interview. From week 12 to 16, negotiations move to offer and contract signing. The partner remains present during the offer conversation to mediate expectations on compensation, start dates, and relocation requirements. From the initial brief session to a signed contract, the search typically concludes within twelve to sixteen weeks.',
	'k56c34c64' => 'Privacy policy',
