	'k586d408b' => 'No. We hold an absolute policy never to approach professionals currently working at our active client organisations. During the brief session, we document all current commercial relationships and define the off-limits boundary explicitly in writing. Unlike global aggregator search firms that have compromised outreach pools because large proportions of the industry are off-limits, our boutique roster allows us broad market access while strictly honoring existing client relationships. We believe that trust is impossible if an executive search firm recruits from the very businesses that retain its counsel. That line is drawn before research begins and is never crossed under any circumstances.',
