	'k5ed73534' => 'To help our partners evaluate whether we are the appropriate firm for your mandate, please outline five key elements in your inquiry: the senior role title, the direct reporting line, the primary geographic location, your target hiring timeline, and the clear line you will not cross. This boundary might include specific competitor firms that must not be approached, non-negotiable compensation ceilings, or sensitive governance considerations. Providing these details upfront allows our partners to verify that we have no conflicting client relationships or capacity limitations under our six-search rule before we schedule the initial consultation.',
