	'k9b410351' => 'Open a search',
	'k9bbf0d40' => 'Senbatsu Partners was established in 2012 at Oostelijke Handelskade 1210 in Amsterdam to provide boards, founders and chief executives with an alternative to volume-driven recruitment. In contingent recruitment, agencies race to present visible candidates who are already actively seeking new employment. We operate exclusively on a retained basis because senior leadership appointments require thorough, patient market mapping and unhurried discernment. When an organisation needs to appoint a board member or chief executive, the strongest candidates are almost never looking at job listings. Retained search allows our partners to invest weeks in confidential research, approaching individuals discreetly and evaluating suitability against a detailed role brief. This deliberate model ensures that our interests remain strictly aligned with our clients, eliminating pressure to make hasty introductions.',
