	'ka4c524fb' => 'Scheduling the brief session',
	'ka5eafbc0' => 'Behind each partner stands a dedicated operational and research team based in our Amsterdam office. Jonas Weber serves as Research Lead, directing the market maps and constructing the rigorous long list of about 60 qualified names for every mandate. Priya Raman is our Associate, managing independent referencing, structured candidate assessments, and background evaluations. Claire Duval serves as Client Office Manager, coordinating brief sessions on Tuesdays and Thursdays, managing contract administration, and overseeing client invoicing. Working in tight coordination from Oostelijke Handelskade 1210, our seven-person team provides boards and chief executives with an agile, high-conviction search practice free from the administrative overhead of large multi-practice consultancies.',
	'ka7bf84fc' => 'Contingent recruitment only compensates a recruiter when a candidate is hired, which inherently incentivizes speed over quality and volume over precision. Recruiters under contingent contracts cannot afford to spend four weeks constructing an exhaustive market map of 60 professionals or referencing individuals who are not actively seeking employment. Retained executive search provides the resources and dedicated partner commitment required to execute thorough, discreet research across entire European sectors. By paying in milestone instalments, our clients secure the dedicated time of an experienced partner who conducts every interview personally, holds confidential candidate relationships, and ensures that the eventual shortlist of three represents the best available talent rather than merely the most accessible.',
	'ka919daaa' => 'These commercial terms govern all retained executive search mandates and advisory assignments undertaken by Senbatsu Partners. They reflect our commitment to predictable timelines, transparent billing, and mutual accountability.',
