	'kbb001568' => 'Chief Commercial Officer',
	'kbb82ed40' => 'If a mandate is cancelled or suspended by the client, instalments already paid are non-refundable. Reimbursable expenses, covering travel and assessment tools at direct cost, are capped at 8% of the agreed search fee. We hold an absolute house policy on client protection: under no circumstances will Senbatsu Partners approach executives employed by an active client organisation. Furthermore, if an executive appointed through our search leaves the organisation within 12 months of their start date, we will conduct a new search for the same seat charging direct expenses only, with no additional search fee. This twelve-month re-search policy reflects our high conviction in candidate assessment and long-term placement viability.',
