	'kc482980d' => 'Finance',
	'kc57f71bd' => 'One partner, from brief to start',
	'kc63a53f0' => 'Our fee schedule contains seven distinct items with no hidden costs. A brief session is €4,800, covering a half day with two partners and a written role brief, which is fully credited against the search fee if a search opens. A standard retained search costs 30% of first-year base plus target bonus for the full process through to a signed offer. A minimum search fee of €48,000 applies when that 30% calculation would be lower. For a board chair or non-executive seat, we charge a fixed fee of €36,000 for the complete process. Clients seeking intelligence without candidate outreach can commission a market map only for €18,000, delivering weeks one to four as a standalone report. Internal candidate assessment is €6,500 per person, providing one structured assessment and two references. Travel and assessment tool expenses are billed at direct cost and capped at 8% of the search fee.',
	'kc6fd480c' => 'Retained search mandates are undertaken for a professional fee equal to 30% of the placed candidate\'s first-year base salary plus target bonus, subject to a minimum search fee of €48,000. Board chair and non-executive appointments are billed at a fixed fee of €36,000. All fees are invoiced in EUR and exclude VAT. Payments are scheduled across three equal instalments: one third upon agreement signing, one third upon presentation of the shortlist of 3 candidates by week 6, and one third upon signed offer acceptance. The €4,800 brief session fee is credited in full against the search fee upon engagement initiation. Market maps commissioned without candidate outreach are billed at €18,000 upon delivery. Invoices are due within thirty days of issuance.',
	'kc714676e' => 'Senbatsu Partners is an independent retained search partnership based in Amsterdam. We maintain a deliberate partnership model where each partner personally leads a limited number of senior leadership mandates.',
	'kc790a4a0' => 'Why retained and not contingent?',
	'kc8738cb2' => 'Thank you for contacting Senbatsu Partners regarding your executive leadership search. Your inquiry has been delivered directly to our partners in Amsterdam.',
	'kcd5fffc0' => 'Weeks 12–16 — Offer and start.',
	'kcda92839' => 'Weeks 1–4 as a report, no approaches',
	'kce192b7e' => 'Helena founded the firm in 2012 and leads the finance and board searches. She writes the first draft of every role brief she attends.',
	'kd0296008' => 'A search partner will review your message, the requested leadership seat, and your proposed timing before replying within two working days. Our Amsterdam office at Oostelijke Handelskade 1210 operates Monday through Friday between 08:30 and 18:00 CET. Because our partners limit their active commitments to at most 6 searches at a time, we verify that your mandate aligns with our sector expertise and that no conflicts of interest exist with your direct commercial competitors before scheduling the initial consultation.',
	'kd1993ffe' => 'Information to include in your inquiry',
	'kd2c42982' => 'Selected seats. Client names are never published.',
	'kd3b6dbf6' => 'A retained search begins long before any candidate is approached. When a board or founder needs to fill an executive vacancy, we conduct a half-day working session to define the role, the mandate, and the explicit boundary of who we will not approach. Writing this down creates the discipline that protects your organization throughout the search.',
	'kd49bc927' => 'Research, assessment and client operations',
	'kd6deab24' => 'Our complete fee schedule',
	'kd73d287d' => 'Board Chair and non-executive',
	'kd740e429' => 'We review about 60 qualified names across relevant markets and sectors. No candidate is approached until the written role brief has been signed off by the client.',
	'kd8b00929' => 'Germany',
	'kd9921072' => 'How confidential is the search?',
	'kda73ea73' => 'Commercial terms and payment schedules',
	'kdb16d58d' => 'Weeks 1–4 — Market map.',
	'kdb1e46fc' => 'Operations, logistics and supply-chain leadership for groups that run on physical flow.',
	'kdc81ec76' => 'Priya runs the two references for each person on the shortlist and the structured assessments. She writes up what was said, not what was hoped.',
	'kdcc61c91' => 'Technology, product and data leadership where engineering decisions shape the business.',
	'kdd7d0051' => 'If your search proceeds, Claire Duval will coordinate a half-day brief session with two partners at your offices, typically scheduled for a Tuesday or Thursday. During this session, we will establish your corporate governance requirements, evaluate reporting lines, and draft the formal role brief that establishes the line we will not cross. If you require immediate confidential assistance or wish to provide additional documentation in the interim, please contact our Amsterdam office directly at +31 20 555 0142 or search@senbatsu-partners.example.',
	'kdd92aa80' => 'Weeks 7 to 16: Interviews, offer and start',
	'kde3fb4fb' => 'Tell us about the seat.',
	'kde790d81' => 'Partner · General counsel, compliance',
	'kdec7218f' => 'A foundational house policy at Senbatsu Partners is that each partner leads at most 6 searches at a time. In traditional executive search firms, senior partners frequently pitch the engagement before delegating the research and interviews to junior associates. We reject that division of labour. The partner who attends your initial brief session is the same partner who reviews the market map of about 60 names, interviews every prospective candidate in person, and attends the final offer negotiation. Helena Marsh, Tomás Ferreira, Amara Okonkwo and Mei-Lin Huang lead their searches directly from start to finish. Capping partner capacity at six simultaneous mandates ensures that each search receives undivided attention, rigorous referencing, and continuous counsel throughout the twelve to sixteen weeks of the assignment.',
	'ke16336e3' => 'Priya Raman',
	'ke1bf6a12' => 'During weeks one to four, Jonas Weber leads research to construct a comprehensive market map. We identify and review a long list of about 60 qualified individuals currently holding comparable responsibility in relevant European sectors. This research is conducted through direct primary intelligence, industry network verification, and systematic organizational mapping rather than keyword database searching. Crucially, nobody is approached until the partner validates that each candidate meets the criteria established in the signed brief. The market map provides the client with a transparent perspective on executive availability, compensation benchmarks, and geographic mobility across target sectors.',
	'ke2897122' => 'You conduct structured interviews with the shortlisted candidates while we coordinate feedback, conduct secondary referencing, and resolve practical questions.',
	'ke5073291' => 'All fees are quoted in EUR and exclude VAT. The retained search fee is paid in three equal instalments: at signing, at the shortlist and at the start date. If the person we placed leaves within 12 months, we run the search again for expenses only.',
	'ke6483c84' => 'A search starts at the brief',
	'ke68921de' => 'Four partners, one rule',
	'ke6a1cc0d' => 'What if the shortlist is not right?',
	'ke6f56f3b' => 'Because each partner at Senbatsu Partners leads at most 6 searches at a time, our capacity to open new mandates is strictly limited. Formal half-day brief sessions are conducted on Tuesdays and Thursdays at client offices and frequently book several weeks in advance. Subscribers to Search notes receive advance notification when upcoming brief-session dates open up in partner calendars before slots are released to general inquiries. Joining our mailing list ensures your organisation has priority access to initiate a search when an unexpected executive departure or strategic board appointment arises.',
	'ke74867bc' => 'Our partnership comprises four search partners who conduct client mandates directly without delegation. Helena Marsh is our founding partner, leading searches for Chief Financial Officer appointments, board chairs, and non-executive director seats. Tomás Ferreira leads executive recruitment for Chief Operating Officer, plant operations, and international supply chain leadership across European industrial sectors. Amara Okonkwo leads our legal and governance practice, focusing on General Counsel and Chief Compliance Officer mandates. Mei-Lin Huang conducts executive searches for Chief Technology Officers, engineering vice presidents, and senior product and data leadership. Each partner manages at most 6 searches simultaneously, ensuring immediate responsiveness and personal leadership throughout every mandate.',
	'ke7e767d7' => 'Technology',
	'ke90b1137' => 'Because our partners establish strict requirements in the brief session and evaluate about 60 names during market mapping, our shortlists of 3 are calibrated with precision. If requirements shift, we continue our market evaluation until 3 qualified candidates are presented.',
	'ke94548be' => 'Never. In our initial brief session we explicitly agree on the line we will not cross. We protect client relationships unconditionally and never recruit from an active client.',
	'ke977164b' => 'The partner you meet<br>is the partner who searches.',
	'ke979a02b' => 'Cancellation, client protection and re-search policy',
	'kea6d13ed' => 'Oostelijke Handelskade 1210<br>1019 BL Amsterdam<br><a href="mailto:search@senbatsu-partners.example">search@senbatsu-partners.example</a><br>+31 20 555 0142<br>Mon–Fri 08:30–18:00 CET',
	'keadc185c' => 'Sector',
	'keb37b12b' => 'What it covers',
	'keb5d2793' => 'Contingent fees',
	'keb7297e9' => 'Fee',
	'keb7ccfd2' => 'Weeks 7–11 — Interviews and references.',
	'keb8ae4d4' => 'We use your address only for Search notes. Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.',
	'kebbef45f' => 'Reports to the CEO and the audit committee',
	'kec1f90d7' => 'Chief People Officer',
	'kee542dd0' => 'Letters from recent searches',
	'kf09564c9' => 'Q',
	'kf131a97a' => 'By week six, the partner presents a shortlist of exactly 3 candidates. We do not overwhelm client search committees with long binders of speculative resumes. Every person on our shortlist has been met in person by the partner leading the search, rigorously evaluated against the brief, referenced twice through discreet background inquiries, and has confirmed active interest in the role and compensation structure. Delivering three thoroughly vetted, interested candidates allows the board or chief executive to focus their evaluation on strategic leadership chemistry, cultural alignment, and long-term vision.',
	'kf155f638' => 'How a shortlist of three is made',
	'kf2dbbdc0' => 'Legal and compliance leadership for companies under inspection, listing or deal pressure.',
